DESCRIPTION:GROCERY SHOPPING LIST\n==================================================\n\n• Beef: 350 gram\n• Carrot: 1 unit\n• Cauliflower: 0.5 unit\n• Chestnut: 0.5 cup\n• Chicken Thighs: 2 unit\n• Chinese Eggplants: 2 unit\n• Chinese Ham Sausage: 1 unit\n• Chopped Whole Chicken: 500 g\n• Corn: 0.5 cup\n• Corn Flour: 50 g\n• Curry Block: 1 block\n• Egg: 1 unit\n• Fish: 1 unit\n• Flour: 50 g\n• Garlic: 3 big clove\n• Garlic Powder: 1 tablespoon\n• Ginger: 5 slice\n• Green Onion: 2 unit\n• Green Onions: 3 unit\n• Green Pepper: 1 -2 unit\n• Honey: 1 tablespoon\n• Jalapeno Pepper: 1 unit\n• Lemon: 0.5 unit\n• Mango: 1 unit\n• Olive Oil: 20 ml\n• Onion: 0.5 unit\n• Oyster Sauce: 3.5 tablespoon\n• Paprika: 1 tablespoon\n• Pixian Doubanjiang: 1 tablespoon\n• Rice: 2 cup\n• Salt: 1 teaspoon\n• Sesame Oil: 3.5 tablespoon\n• Shiitake Mushroom: 4 unit\n• Shrimp: 1 lb\n• Soy Sauce: 12 tablespoon\n• Sugar: 1.5 tablespoon\n• Tomato: 1 unit\n• Tomatoes: 10 unit\n• Vegetable Oil: 5 tablespoon\n• Vinegar: 2 tablespoon\n• Warm Water: 80 g\n• White Sesame: 1 tablespoon\n• Any Vegetables Or Proteins: as needed\n• Black Pepper: as needed\n• Cooked Rice For Serving: as needed\n• Goji Berries: as needed\n• Oil: as needed\n• Parsley Flakes: as needed\n• Pepper: as needed\n• Red Dates: as needed\n• Salmon Or Chicken: as needed\n• Scallions: as needed\n• Starch: as needed\n• Dried Mushrooms: Any (shiitake mushrooms\, bamboo fungus\, cordyceps flower\, tea tree mushrooms\, morels\, chanterelles\, king oyster mushrooms)\n\nTotal ingredients: 54
